{"uid":"a0db4c039ddb7bcf","name":"test_unpause_proxy_releases_a_real_operator_input_needed_pause","fullName":"tests.test_hub_unpause#test_unpause_proxy_releases_a_real_operator_input_needed_pause","historyId":"feecf6a32957904341a74c46ec1970ea","time":{"start":1791916120117,"stop":1791916120767,"duration":650},"description":"The genuine article: a real run's engine holds `pauseReason:\n    \"operator_input_needed\"` on `status.json` (`LoopSupervisor.pause`,\n    exactly the method the engine's own `operator_input_needed` escalation\n    edges call -- see `loop.py::_pause_and_escalate_operator_input_needed`).\n    The hub's `POST /api/runs/<id>/unpause` -- never a second, hub-owned\n    unpause mechanism -- reaches the SAME `POST /resume` route\n    `ralphctl unpause` calls, and the pause is released on the real engine's\n    own `/status`, not merely echoed back by the hub.","descriptionHtml":"<p>The genuine article: a real run's engine holds <code>pauseReason: &quot;operator_input_needed&quot;</code> on <code>status.json</code> (<code>LoopSupervisor.pause</code>,<br />\nexactly the method the engine's own <code>operator_input_needed</code> escalation<br />\nedges call -- see <code>loop.py::_pause_and_escalate_operator_input_needed</code>).<br />\nThe hub's <code>POST /api/runs/&lt;id&gt;/unpause</code> -- never a second, hub-owned<br />\nunpause mechanism -- reaches the SAME <code>POST /resume</code> route<br />\n<code>ralphctl unpause</code> calls, and the pause is released on the real engine's<br />\nown <code>/status</code>, not merely echoed back by the hub.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791916120094,"stop":1791916120094,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},